    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zen Chess: Mate in Three</strong> is a minimalist chess puzzle game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for chess lovers of <strong>all levels </strong>(even if you just learned how to move the pieces); </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve 300 puzzles <strong>carefully selected </strong>by a Chess Grandmaster (TOP 200 in the world); </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a minimalist, <strong>beautifully designed</strong> chess board and pieces; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original soundtrack</strong>, specially composed to help you keep your focus and concentration; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything in the game was made with a lot of <strong>love</strong> and <strong>craftsmanship</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you find the three moves that will solve each puzzle? Give it a try and show yourself you are a true chess master.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zen Chess: Mate in Three</strong> is a minimalist chess puzzle game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for chess lovers of <strong>all levels </strong>(even if you just learned how to move the pieces); </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve 300 puzzles <strong>carefully selected </strong>by a Chess Grandmaster (TOP 200 in the world); </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a minimalist, <strong>beautifully designed</strong> chess board and pieces; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original soundtrack</strong>, specially composed to help you keep your focus and concentration; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything in the game was made with a lot of <strong>love</strong> and <strong>craftsmanship</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you find the three moves that will solve each puzzle? Give it a try and show yourself you are a true chess master.</p>",
